WEBVTT

00:29:28.520 --> 00:29:31.736
so I got an iPad, a second iPad.

00:29:31.760 --> 00:29:34.956
I have a little TV next,
over my right shoulder,

00:29:34.980 --> 00:29:38.136
so I can monitor the situation.

00:29:38.160 --> 00:29:40.946
AG: You might have your own
personal mission control center

00:29:40.970 --> 00:29:42.976
as you navigate working remotely.

00:29:43.000 --> 00:29:46.735
But "mission control" has an entirely
different meaning to Scott Kelly,

00:29:46.759 --> 00:29:48.306
because he's an astronaut.

00:29:48.330 --> 00:29:50.666
SK: So, five years ago today,

00:29:50.690 --> 00:29:55.066
I launched into space for my mission

00:29:55.090 --> 00:29:58.326
that wound up being 340 days

00:29:58.350 --> 00:30:00.370
on the ISS.